wicca my cat died trying to eat the watch captian.  found a harp that
tamed a gnome for me.  I called him Cyojeoco the Near Sighted.  He was
so far under my spell that he started killing other gnomes immediatly. 
I ate a hill orc that poly'd to stalker to get invisible.  it wasn't
permanent. Cyojeoco the Near Sighted jumped onto the poly trap and
became a dragon and then jumped on again to become an elf. finally ended
up with a skeleton.  he died while trying to take on a shopkeeper.  then
I tamed a green dragon. called him Brehoto the Reptile.  he managed to
kill the shopkeepers except one.  went on a shopping trip to the rest of
the shops then went to my water spot dilluted and went to my stash with
altar.  blessed all the right stuff and read a whole bunch of books. 
throne let me genocide master mind flayer and gave me see invisible.  I
kept going deeper skipped quest for now.  I killed white dragon and
transformed scales to improve AC this got me down to -12.  I also
finally got a mattock.  Sac for a while and got the sunsword.  Found an
amulet of reflection.  Once I get the experience I might try the quest. 
My best arch so far died there last time.  found ring of teleport
control so I got teleportitis from a leprechaun.  Continued my reign of
terror, my pet kept killing shopkeepers and I had so much gold all I had
to do was find a priest.  the minetown one died.  I got my matter skill
to basic by using knock and my key on a door 20 times.  I kept casting
light in all dark rooms to get divination up. and attack was maxed out
by the use of magic missile.  I got crowned in minetown praying.  Maybe
I won't get grayswinder.  I had to polypile for a ring of levitation. 
got a book of create monster, did some sacrificing on the way to medusa,
didn't get anything.  Reptile got disitigrated by a black dragon.  I
used the wand from castle to wish for ascension kit.  then went to do
the quest.  Of course on the first level of the quest I find two of
things I had wished for!  the helm of brilliance was found at +5. 
killed minion it was easy used potion of paralysis and then twoweaponed
with grey and silver saber. he died quick.  found scroll of genocide
blessed it and wiped out L.  I know I'm using every cheap trick that is
possible in nethack.  got my first wand of death on level 40.  found the
vb and then went back up had a sac party and got some artifacts.  then
went to stash and polypiled for some other stuff.  got a magic marker,
can of grease, scroll of gold dectect, unholy water and ring of free
action.  enchanted my stuff to max or close and then went after the
wizard. a gremlin got loose on the medusa level so there was gremlins
everywhere.  dumb move I used a wand of cold to bridge moat.  there was
a hell pup in there he melted the ice and sent me for a swim boh was
greased so damage was minimal.  on plain of air realized I had poly
piled all my wands of teleport.  I had to use 2 cursed scolls of gold
detect to find portal and some wands of death to save my life.  Hid in a
steam vortex to heal up.  also meant on astral I had to hack threw
everything.

